(xvi)
the Director-General of the National Disaster Response Force, ex officio ;

(xvii)
the Deputy Chief of Integrated Defence Staff, Doctrine Organisation and Training (DOT), Head Quarters Integrated
Defence Staff, Ministry of Defence, ex officio ;
